{"forumTopic": {"authorId": 32898684, "authorThumbnailName": "32898684-kg.jpg?t=2026-03-12-13-50-11", "authorUserDisplayName": "Jakup Ymeraj", "authorUserName": "kupedata", "comments": [{"id": 3496670, "postDate": "2026-07-14T12:18:26.160Z", "rawMarkdown": "Me neither.", "content": "<p>Me neither.</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Jules", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/73012-kg.jpg?t=2023-08-31-11-58-57", "url": "/julesvanligtenberg", "tier": "MASTER", "id": 73012, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 1992, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Jules", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/73012-kg.jpg?t=2023-08-31-11-58-57", "url": "/julesvanligtenberg", "userName": "julesvanligtenberg", "tier": "MASTER", "id": 73012, "profileUrl": "/julesvanligtenberg", "performanceTier": "MASTER", "userId": 73012, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3496568, "postDate": "2026-07-14T07:17:33.360Z", "rawMarkdown": "No, I do not.", "content": "<p>No, I do not.</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Jakob Br\u00fcggen", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/34247700-kg.png?t=2026-05-26-13-50-13", "url": "/jakobbrggen", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 34247700, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 57, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Jakob Br\u00fcggen", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/34247700-kg.png?t=2026-05-26-13-50-13", "url": "/jakobbrggen", "userName": "jakobbrggen", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 34247700, "profileUrl": "/jakobbrggen", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 34247700, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3499579, "postDate": "2026-07-17T16:30:21.650Z", "rawMarkdown": "This accelerator is flaking. It's on, then off. I recently wasted a day trying to load it 10 times before I realized it wasn't connecting. The crash, which should have occurred after 3-5 minutes, only shows up an hour later. But it works\u2014it's registered in the kernel-metadata.json and set with the control key during loading. \n\n kernel-metadata.json\n\n  \"enable_gpu\": true,\n  \"enable_tpu\": false,\n  \"enable_internet\": false,\n  \"machine_shape\": \"NvidiaRtxPro6000\",\n\nAnd load notebook comand: python -m kaggle kernels push -p notebooks --accelerator NvidiaRtxPro6000", "content": "<p>This accelerator is flaking. It's on, then off. I recently wasted a day trying to load it 10 times before I realized it wasn't connecting. The crash, which should have occurred after 3-5 minutes, only shows up an hour later. But it works\u2014it's registered in the kernel-metadata.json and set with the control key during loading. </p>\n<p>kernel-metadata.json</p>\n<p>\"enable_gpu\": true,\n  \"enable_tpu\": false,\n  \"enable_internet\": false,\n  \"machine_shape\": \"NvidiaRtxPro6000\",</p>\n<p>And load notebook comand: python -m kaggle kernels push -p notebooks --accelerator NvidiaRtxPro6000</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Vladimir Yakunin", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16404140-kg.jpg?t=2026-07-16-20-38-42", "url": "/vladimiryakunin", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16404140, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 2482, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Vladimir Yakunin", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16404140-kg.jpg?t=2026-07-16-20-38-42", "url": "/vladimiryakunin", "userName": "vladimiryakunin", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16404140, "profileUrl": "/vladimiryakunin", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 16404140, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3496879, "postDate": "2026-07-14T19:04:24.933Z", "rawMarkdown": "", "parent": {}, "author": {"thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png", "url": "/"}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {}, "canDelete": true, "isUserAuthor": true, "isDeleted": true, "kernelVersion": 0, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false}], "commentSort": "COMMENT_LIST_SORT_BY_HOT", "firstMessage": {"id": 3496238, "postDate": "2026-07-13T13:11:38.850Z", "rawMarkdown": "# Do you still have access to the RTX PRO 6000 GPU?", "content": "<h1>Do you still have access to the RTX PRO 6000 GPU?</h1>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Jakup Ymeraj", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/32898684-kg.jpg?t=2026-03-12-13-50-11", "url": "/kupedata", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 32898684, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "TOPIC", "votes": {"totalVotes": 4, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 4}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 561, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Jakup Ymeraj", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/32898684-kg.jpg?t=2026-03-12-13-50-11", "url": "/kupedata", "userName": "kupedata", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 32898684, "profileUrl": "/kupedata", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 32898684, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, "firstMessageId": 3496238, "forumId": 10403401, "forumName": "ARC Prize 2026 - ARC-AGI-3", "id": 724890, "name": "About using GPU RTX PRO 6000", "parentName": "arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3", "parentUrl": "/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3", "postDate": "2026-07-13T13:11:38.850114600Z", "totalVotes": 4, "url": "/competit